   Houge, Gunnar Douzgos; Houge, Sofia Douzgou, Haukeland Hosp, Dept Med Genet, Bergen, Norway.
   Hsieh, Tzung-Chien, Rhein Friedrich Wilhelms Univ Bonn, Univ Hosp Bonn, Inst Genom Stat \& Bioinformat, Bonn, Germany.
   Verbinnen, Iris; Janssens, Veerle, Univ Leuven, Dept Cellular \& Mol Med, Lab Prot Phosphorylat \& Prote, Leuven, Belgium.
